    'Mobile vs Desktop Tracking\n\n' +
    analytics.message + '\n\n' +
    'This feature will track:\n' +
    '• Total user sessions\n' +
    '• Mobile vs Desktop percentage\n' +
    '• Device type breakdown\n' +
    '• Peak usage times',
    SpreadsheetApp.getUi().ButtonSet.OK
  );
}

